{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RACCOIN: Coin Pusher Roguelike Demo</strong> blends the chaotic fun of classic arcade coin pushers with the element of roguelike deckbuilding. Combine special coins with powerful items to trigger satisfying synergies. It\u2019s a nonstop dopamine rush packed into one unpredictable, coin dropping ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054170/extras/7d9d5f300d059342e6ab6cb271b1f26c.poster.avif?t=1762761561\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054170/extras/7d9d5f300d059342e6ab6cb271b1f26c.webm?t=1762761561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054170/extras/7d9d5f300d059342e6ab6cb271b1f26c.mp4?t=1762761561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054170/extras/12ac2c57f179c24062bf72a9531d5753.avif?t=1762761561\" width=1228 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover all kinds of special coins during your runs! Combine Seed Coins with Water Coins to grow a money tree right inside your machine. Drop a Cat Coin to hunt down every last Rat Coin and rack up extra tickets. Need more points? Use a Multiply Coin to boost your score across the board. Too slow? Launch a Nuclear Coin to trigger a massive explosion and blast every coin forward at once!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054170/extras/01bebf0bef78f426032a1c844b8e4828.poster.avif?t=1762761561\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054170/extras/01bebf0bef78f426032a1c844b8e4828.webm?t=1762761561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054170/extras/01bebf0bef78f426032a1c844b8e4828.mp4?t=1762761561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054170/extras/1ca589efb0826f39c287caef90bf9819.avif?t=1762761561\" width=1228 height=255 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover over 120 unique items that can dramatically shift the course of your run. Stack multipliers, spawn coins with extra points, or simply shake the machine when you're running dry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apply special plating to your favorite coins to enhance their effects and unlock even wilder combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054170/extras/077081d5d0c676423ff7dbf00ac930e6.poster.avif?t=1762761561\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054170/extras/077081d5d0c676423ff7dbf00ac930e6.webm?t=1762761561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054170/extras/077081d5d0c676423ff7dbf00ac930e6.mp4?t=1762761561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054170/extras/6b019679145cb48d0aa700962e340cd1.avif?t=1762761561\" width=1228 height=278 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of several unique characters, each with their own set of themed coins and playstyle. Take on the role of a greedy raccoon manager who excels at math-based combos, or a quirky biologist who specializes in animal-based coins. Every character offers a fresh and wildly different way to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054170/extras/64c96b7635c74842e1ca1da9410fbf4c.poster.avif?t=1762761561\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054170/extras/64c96b7635c74842e1ca1da9410fbf4c.webm?t=1762761561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054170/extras/7ea1a0b0fed85a595ece9aac44859f22.avif?t=1762761561\" width=1560 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 playable characters<strong>, each with their own unique coins</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ distinct coins <strong>with special effects</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ power-up items <strong>with unique abilities</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054170?t=1762761561","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054170?t=1762761561","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054170/0dad895e33bdb44deb70a48ae2dd9ee6b5860ef9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=17627